{
    // Maturity liquidation, run with the bond as SELF via context variable 0.
    // R6(3) is maturity (Long); R6(1) is the lender-funded nanoERG fee reserve.
    // This expression sends all collateral tokens and at least SELF.value - fee to the vault.
    // The bond itself pins that vault, its R4/R5 tags, and the singleton burn.
    //
    // LIQUIDATION SCRIPT RULES (also apply to future expressions)
    // - Use getVar[Int](1) for settlement, exactly as the bond does; never selfBoxIndex.
    // - Context variables are untrusted: validate indices before indexing OUTPUTS.
    // - Every additional bond-specific payout must require R4[Coll[Byte]] == SELF.id.
    // - Require distinct indices for separate payout obligations within the same bond.
    //   R4 prevents sharing across bonds, but cannot separate roles within one bond.
    // - The bond pins the vault, R4/R5, R6 = 1.toByte and singleton burn; the expression must enforce
    //   eligibility and economics on that same settlement and any additional payouts.
    // - R6 is (repayment, fee reserve, agreed principal ERG, Long maturity); R7 holds principal tokens.
    //   Exclude R6(1) from collateral valuation: that reserve is lender-funded and can be arbitrarily large.
    // - Var 0 is the expression; var 1 is settlement; var 2 is reserved for repayment return.
    //
    // ASSUMPTIONS
    // - The originating order required the fee on top of its entire collateral ERG.
    // - tokens(0) is the bond singleton; only tokens(1..) are collateral.
    // - Repayment closes at maturity, so this rule leaves no gap or overlap.
    val settlementIndex = getVar[Int](1).get
    if (settlementIndex < 0 || settlementIndex >= OUTPUTS.size) {
        sigmaProp(false)
    } else {
        val settlementBox    = OUTPUTS(settlementIndex)
        val batchingFee      = SELF.R6[Coll[Long]].get(1)
        val collateralAssets = SELF.tokens.slice(1, SELF.tokens.size)

        sigmaProp(
            HEIGHT.toLong >= SELF.R6[Coll[Long]].get(3) &&
            settlementBox.tokens == collateralAssets &&
            settlementBox.value >= SELF.value - batchingFee
        )
    }
}
